* Malachite consensus on Arc
** Engine
*** Tendermint-family BFT in Rust
*** Informal Systems origin, Circle fork v0.8.0
*** Channel app API, ProposalAndParts
** Round
*** Propose / prevote / precommit
*** >2/3 voting power, one decision per height
*** Linear timeouts from ProtocolConfig
*** 500 ms target block time
** Validators
*** Permissioned PoA registry
*** Set read at H-1, effective at H
*** Round-robin proposer, not weighted
*** Ed25519, remote Nitro signer
left side
** CL / EL coupling
*** Engine API: FCU, getPayload, newPayload
*** head = safe = finalized
*** 128 KiB signed proposal chunks
*** Timestamp skew gate (30 s)
** Operations
*** redb store + WAL, re-propose on restart
*** P2P value sync and RPC sync
*** Evidence stored, no slashing
** Compared with
*** CometBFT: weighted proposer, H+2 sets
*** HotStuff / HyperBFT: linear view change
*** Gasper: fork choice + 2-epoch finality
*** Ouroboros, TowerBFT: probabilistic
@endmindmap
